# Build context hygiene: a smaller context is a faster build, and anything
# excluded here cannot be baked into a layer by accident.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
tests/
*.md
!README.md

# Never into an image, even though these are gitignored too. Secrets copied
# into a layer survive in the image history even if a later layer deletes them.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
